      "key": "love-me",
      "label": "LOVE ME (JTBC drama)",
      "summary": "Dahyun's 2025 JTBC drama, with Seo Hyun-jin as Jun-kyung, an obstetrician whose perfect-looking single life hides a deep loneliness, and her family after a loss. Twelve episodes, two each Friday from December 19, 2025. It's on Viki officially; these episodes are DahyunFlix's copies with English, Spanish, Portuguese, French, Thai, Malay, Indonesian and Arabic subtitles."
    },
